<title>USA: NYSE closing averages.</title>
<headline>NYSE closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the New York Stock Exchange closed higher in moderate trading Tuesday.</p>
<p>The Dow Jones Industrial Average rose 32.18 to 5648.39.</p>
<p>The NYSE composite rose 0.77 to 351.76.</p>
<p>The average price per share rose $0.09.</p>
<p>Losers beat gainers 1392 to 1015.</p>
<p>Volume was 333,492,780, compared with 256,946,170 Friday.</p>
